x27;t even go so far as to say he believes anything he says.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AthopeMarie/status/1682057998011711488\">https://x.com/AthopeMarie/status/1682057998011711488</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1682122434856595456</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1682122434856595456\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-07-20T20:16:55Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1682162400823324673":{"a":"<p>I have to say after watching a lot of Twitter UFO videos they are almost exclusively birds. The shaky camera and the video compression on modern cameras make them look like little black or white or gray balls darting around. The ones blinking ICAO navigation light patterns are…</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1682162400823324673</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1682162400823324673\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-07-20T22:55:44Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1682163388418252800":{"a":"<p>About 7 years ago they had an awesome AI called Siri. not very chatty but useful. Every day since it seems like Siri has had all the useful features removed. It can&#x27;t even answer basic questions any more. It&#x27;s pretty much useless. Which is disappointing because it was very handy. <a href=\"https://x.com/igor_os777/status/1682162111202603008\">Tweet by @igor_os777</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/igor_os777/status/1682162111202603008\">https://x.com/igor_os777/status/1682162111202603008</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1682163388418252800</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1682163388418252800\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-07-20T22:59:39Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1682164740120879104":{"a":"<p>That takes me back to my childhood. I used to sand down 20 Lira coins and buy myself RC Cola at the local swimming pool. 40 Lira was worth about 5 cents back then. To be fair, that is also about what a can of soda in bulk cost back then. 🤪🤷🏻‍♂️ RC was the only thing not empty. <a href=\"https://x.com/NostalgiaFolder/status/1681866266884161536\">Tweet by @NostalgiaFolder</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/NostalgiaFolder/status/1681866266884161536\">https://x.com/NostalgiaFolder/status/1681866266884161536</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1682164740120879104</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1682164740120879104\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-07-20T23:05:01Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1682166180415504387":{"a":"<p>I sit corrected. They were 100 Lira. So more like 25 cents USD. Anyway, we had a mountain of them from a trip to Rome and no one complained if I put them to use. 😂 Not my fault they didn&#x27;t buy the good coin acceptor. I was just a dumb thirsty kid. t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1682166180415504387-F1hBOe-WIAIJNhB.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1682166180415504387</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1682166180415504387\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-07-20T23:10:45Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}